cifs: set resolved ip in sockaddr

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@cjr.nz>
commit 6d740164d8903e6a0e98c30f80fac6af19ce0a21
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/6d740164.failed

All callers from dns_resolve_server_name_to_ip() used to convert the
ip addr string back to sockaddr, so do that inside
dns_resolve_server_name_to_ip() and avoid duplicating code.

	Signed-off-by: Paulo Alcantara (SUSE) <pc@cjr.nz>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6d740164d8903e6a0e98c30f80fac6af19ce0a21)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

# Conflicts:
#	fs/cifs/connect.c
#	fs/cifs/dfs.c
#	fs/cifs/dns_resolve.c
#	fs/cifs/misc.c
